    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028",
        "name2": "char_243_waaifu_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You're strong. And you've shown me some really cool kung fu.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gambino"
    },
    {
        "text": "But I can't keep playin' with you like this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gambino"
    },
    {
        "text": "Real sorry about this, but you, your buddy, and that traitor, you all gotta die here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gambino"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Boys, weapons ready.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gambino"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_031",
        "name2": "avg_npc_031"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ready!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028#3",
        "name2": "char_243_waaifu_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "So you're going to win with sheer numbers...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Waai Fu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_027#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "It ain't so simple, Gambino.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Capone"
    },
    {
        "text": "Listen up, once the so-called 'boss' opens fire, that's the official announcement of the end of your affiliation with the Gambino Family. Don't go easy on 'em.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Capone"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_031",
        "name2": "avg_npc_031"
    },
    {
        "text": "Got it!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1#4",
        "name2": "char_243_waaifu_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Waai Fu, this side too...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jaye"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1#4",
        "name2": "char_243_waaifu_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "We're getting boxed in.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Waai Fu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hah. We got the Family all split up, and the prey becomes the predator. We got a nice chaotic battle here each fallin' into each other's traps.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gambino"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's just like that time back in Siracusa... But this time, it's a gamble we got no choice but to win.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gambino"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Too bad you've always been a shit gambler.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Capone"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "All right. That's enough. Settle down.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_027"
    },
    {
        "text": "What!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Capone"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "You finally crawled out of your filthy hole?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gambino"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034",
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Mr. Gambino, I am truly sorry, but I've given you and your Family so many chances.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034",
        "name2": "avg_npc_028#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "We got no trust between us at all. You really think I'd hand the Family over to some non-Sicilian freak?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gambino"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034",
        "name2": "avg_npc_028#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Sicilian. While I have not once in my life set foot in a Siracusan city, I do know that you are unworthy of describing yourself as such.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034",
        "name2": "avg_npc_028#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...What are you gonna do?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gambino"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_028#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The time for questions has passed, young man. And you have broken the rules far too many times.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "text": "Once was your transgression, another was yours. But it matters not. You have both overstepped your bounds.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_027#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_034#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Capone"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_028#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You goin' back on your deal?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gambino"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034",
        "name2": "avg_npc_028#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I made no deal.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034",
        "name2": "avg_npc_028#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmph. You really think you can take us?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gambino"
    },
    {
        "text": "You sit on a throne in a stinking sewer, telling desperate people who got no choice but to throw down their lives what to do. That's you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gambino"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_028#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "It behooves you, as head of your household, to broaden your horizons.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "text": "Compared to everything we have been through, your little Siracusan fiasco was a stubbed toe.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_028#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Shut up!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gambino"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034#7",
        "name2": "avg_npc_028#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Have you ever seen a true onslaught? What it means to truly have barbarians at your gates?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "text": "When moving cities crash against one another, smoke chokes the skies, and the dying infected rot away by cesspools, crying in hopeless agony?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "text": "You know nothing. And yet you think to fight a city.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_027#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "(He's immensely powerful... him and that woman with him...)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Capone"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Shit, we have to at least stop provoking the Rat King... now is not the time...)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Capone"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034#7",
        "name2": "avg_npc_028#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You think you stand for all of Lungmen?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gambino"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_028#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Lungmen certainly cannot stand for me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_028#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Enough talk! Haah\u2014\u2014!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gambino"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
