    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gambino"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028#2",
        "name2": "char_243_waaifu_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "No one will permit you to strike this old man.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Waai Fu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Get back, Waai Fu!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jaye"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$e_skill_skulsrsword",
        "volume": 0.9
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 1,
        "g": 1,
        "b": 1,
        "afrom": 0,
        "rfrom": 0,
        "gfrom": 0,
        "bfrom": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 1.5,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Out of my way!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gambino"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034#3",
        "name2": "char_272_strong_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Thank you. You are Ah Fil. I've heard your story.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034#3",
        "name2": "char_272_strong_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You're the one Uncle always talks about...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jaye"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034#3",
        "name2": "char_272_strong_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Heh, my old friend.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "text": "I thank you for helping Lungmen put a stop to them. And I thank you for your pursuit of justice.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now, please leave.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_243_waaifu_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "But...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Waai Fu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "I promised many times to many people that I would not let the children get mixed up in such matters.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1",
        "name2": "char_243_waaifu_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...Waai Fu.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jaye"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1",
        "name2": "char_243_waaifu_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Fine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Waai Fu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 3,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$darkalley_intro",
        "key": "$darkalley_loop",
        "volume": 0.8,
        "crossfade": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_028#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The children are gone. And with them your hope of victory.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "text": "Put down your weapons, kneel before me, and your 'Family' will have at least some chance to survive.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_028#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you really think your threats mean anything?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gambino"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034",
        "name2": "avg_npc_028#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...You are on our land. It means to us what Siracusa means to you. You must know this much.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "text": "You still have some chips on the table, young man. Wouldn't you like to save them?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$e_skill_driftsand",
        "volume": 0.9
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_031"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Qui- quicksand?! Run!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso A"
    },
    {
        "text": "Aaaaaagh! My hand! D- don't touch the sand!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034",
        "name2": "avg_npc_028#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You cocky\u2014\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gambino"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$e_skill_driftsand",
        "volume": 0.9
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmph.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gambino"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034#7",
        "name2": "avg_npc_028#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Calm yourself, young man. I don't need my hands to stop your sword.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "text": "Look around you at your companions. This city has bled so much already. I really don't want to see 'Family' killing one another on the program.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is your last chance.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034#7",
        "name2": "avg_npc_028#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I ain't gonna turn coward again. Leaving Siracusa was the last step backwards for my Family.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gambino"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'd rather die here like a true Sicilian than ever let the enemy see me run off with my tail between my legs.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gambino"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_028#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Perhaps in your mind, this is the way for a warrior to behave. But for a leader, going too far is as bad as not going far enough.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "text": "You should reflect, and introspect. Unfortunately, it is too late.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$e_skill_driftsand",
        "volume": 0.9
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_028#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Aaaagh!!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gambino"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_027",
        "name2": "avg_npc_028#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...This is the end, Gambino. You should never have bet the whole Family on this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Capone"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_027",
        "name2": "avg_npc_028#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Capone, you, you son of a\u2014\u2014!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gambino"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_027#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_028#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Calm down. We don't want you to go out too hard.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Capone"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$knifegore",
        "volume": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028#2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Gah!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gambino"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Funny. You don't look surprised at all. Were you waiting for me to do this?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Capone"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What are you thinking, backstabbing boss-killer?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll offer up the whole Family. We're gonna live here, in Lungmen. And we're not gonna fall on our swords for no good reason.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Capone"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "It's too bad... if you were truly willing to work together, that woman never would have exiled you from Siracusa.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You know a lot about us... But I'm not gonna ask. It's Lungmen.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Capone"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Indeed. It's Lungmen.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "text": "You mean I should be easier on you, since you're willing to personally discipline the disobedient?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "My Family will take orders from you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Capone"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "'Your Family.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "text": "You are simply describing the situation as it is. You made so many miscalculations you have no other choice.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Right. It's been a hell of a night. I've had a lotta setbacks. But that's business.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Capone"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Mmm... Business.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're absolutely right. This is an excellent deal. Fair and equitable.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Then\u2014\u2014!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Capone"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$kingmouse_intro",
        "key": "$kingmouse_loop",
        "volume": 0.8,
        "crossfade": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034#7",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "But, Mr. Capone, it's Lungmen.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's not me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034#7",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Capone"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I have no need of your loyalty. Never did.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_soldiersrun",
        "volume": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_031",
        "name2": "avg_npc_031",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_027#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Capone"
    },
    {
        "text": "You... from the very beginning, you were...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Capone"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_031"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's what it is. We gotta survive.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso "
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "When you tried to worm your way into Lungmen, your mutual suspicion ground turned you up into a sheet of sand. A stone is hard to break. But sand? I can easily scoop up a handful.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "text": "I have no love of trickery. It's really no fun at all. What matters is what I said a few minutes ago: I truly do not wish to see family massacre family...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "text": "And yet you did harm to your own brother, right in front of me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now for this, I would not say you've crossed the ultimate line. So I will not kill you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's just that, since you disobeyed me, I'm afraid I have no need of such a crafty and conniving friend.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You...! You had these moles in the Family from the very beginning! And you waited until we got at each other's throats, and then you...!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Capone"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$e_skill_driftsand",
        "volume": 0.9
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Gah!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Capone"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You're wasting your life on idle words, young man.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "text": "Heh... while you toyed around with the power over them, your underlings were mulling it all over for you. Truly remarkable.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "text": "Their loyalty has bought them a chance to survive in Lungmen. And a life for each of you as well.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now then, you have seen for yourselves the choices made by these two leaders, and now the time has come for you to fulfill your commitments.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_027#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Heh.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Capone"
    },
    {
        "text": "Rat King. No, Lin. Lin Gray, you're more Sicilian than either of us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Capone"
    },
    {
        "text": "You tore my honor to shreds, and then you let me live? Are you trying to humiliate me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Capone"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_031"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014\u2014!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Astonishing. To save your life, you don't hesitate to draw a sword on your own brother, your own leader, and yet when I offer to let you live, you are determined to die?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "text": "I thought only the one out cold over there would gnash his teeth at me so.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "That's because I too am 'Sicilian.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Capone"
    },
    {
        "text": "Or I guess I should ask if you really thought you could wipe out one of Siracusa's 'Families' and get away with it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Capone"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Idle threats. You must know that nobody will go to war over an erased Family. Take a step back and see that even though some hopeless, scattered warriors may ignorantly think to act...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034#7",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...I say let them come. Let them be torn to shreds by the true rage of this city.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034#7",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Grr!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Capone"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "You alone have no power to stand against us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now. Go.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_027#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Capone"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_027#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "...I guess my life just has to go on for now, but one day you'll regret that you didn't kill me, a true Sicilian, today.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Capone"
    },
    {
        "text": "No question.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Capone"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$rungeneral",
        "volume": 0.9
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "...If I were to send a man to kill him now, what would you do?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_031",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You wouldn't do that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_031",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "But what he said is true. I have no reason to be so lenient with a Siracusan mafioso.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_031",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "We had a deal. When we came face to face, we'd defect, and you'd let the others go.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_031",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Unless, of course, the remaining mobsters force a fight to the death.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_031",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Heh heh. Don't worry. He didn't mean that. He's simply a coward who wants to live. But his anger is not feigned.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "text": "An unrighteous man has nothing for which to live.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "text": "Remarkable. His negligible dignity saved his life, in the end.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_031",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...Thanks.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034"
    },
    {
        "text": "Go. It is time to bring this evening to its conclusion.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetiem": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    }
]